var FT={"Aereni Expertise":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat for Elves. Proficiency in one skill, then Expertise in that skill.","full":"**Skill Proficiency.** You gain proficiency in one skill of your choice.\n**Expertise.** You gain Expertise in the skill you picked with this feat.","pre":"Elf","pick":[{"k":"sk","t":"skills","n":1,"from":["Acrobatics","Animal Handling","Arcana","Athletics","Deception","History","Insight","Intimidation","Investigation","Medicine","Nature","Perception","Performance","Persuasion","Religion","Sleight of Hand","Stealth","Survival"],"title":"skill proficiency"},{"k":"xp","t":"exp","n":1,"from":"all","title":"Expertise (the skill picked with this feat)"}]},"Aereni Half-Life":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Advantage on Death Saving Throws. Resistance to Necrotic and Radiant damage. Necrotic spells may deal Radiant damage.","full":"Raise Intelligence or Wisdom by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n**Deathless.** You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws.\n**Resistance.** You have Resistance to Necrotic damage and Radiant damage.\n**Radiant Focus.** When you cast a spell that deals Necrotic damage, you can make it deal Radiant damage instead.","pre":"Level 4+, Elf","asi":["INT","WIS"],"fx":{"res":["Necrotic","Radiant"],"notes":[["Advantage","Death Saving Throws (Aereni Half-Life)"]]}},"Aquatic Adaptation":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat. Breathe underwater, Athletics proficiency, Swim Speed equal to your Speed.","full":"**Amphibious.** You can breathe underwater. If you also have Limited Amphibiousness, you no longer need to stay submerged.\n**Athletic Build.** You gain proficiency in Athletics.\n**Natural Swimmer.** You have a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.","fx":{"skills":["Athletics"],"notes":[["Note","Aquatic Adaptation: Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you breathe underwater"]]}},"Changeling Metamorphosis":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"+1 AC. Each time you use Shape-Shifter, pick Aquatic Adaptation, Darkvision or Natural Weapons.","full":"Raise Constitution or Dexterity by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n**Hardened Skin.** You gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class.\n**Metamorphosis.** When you use Shape-Shifter, pick one option below. You keep its benefits until you use Shape-Shifter again.\n**Aquatic Adaptation.** Gills and webbed fingers let you breathe underwater and give you a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.\n**Darkvision.** You have Darkvision 60 ft.\n**Natural Weapons.** You grow claws (Slashing), fangs (Piercing), horns (Piercing) or hooves (Bludgeoning). Your Unarmed Strike with that growth deals 1d6 damage of the listed type instead of its normal damage, and you can use Dexterity instead of Strength for its attack and damage rolls.","pre":"Level 4+, Changeling","asi":["CON","DEX"],"fx":{"notes":[["Note","Changeling Metamorphosis: +1 Armor Class"]]}},"Envoy Specialist":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat for Warforged. Tool proficiency, an integrated tool, and a d4 on checks with it.","full":"**Envoy Competence.** You gain proficiency with one tool of your choice.\n**Integrated Tool.** Pick a tool you are proficient with. A working version is built into your body and cannot be removed. You can use it whenever you have a hand free.\n**Innate Talent.** When you make an ability check with the integrated tool, roll 1d4 and add it to the check.","pre":"Warforged","pick":[{"k":"tl","t":"tool","n":1,"cats":["art","music","game","other"],"title":"Tool proficiency"}]},"Focused Personas":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat for Changelings. Two personas that grant a tool and a skill when you assume them. Know Skin Cant.","full":"Work with your DM to define two distinct personas, each with its own look and manner.\n**Adept Persona.** Pick a tool and tie a persona to it. When you use Shape-Shifter to take that persona, you gain proficiency with the tool and can roll 1d4 and add it to ability checks with it.\n**Expert Persona.** Pick a skill you are proficient in and tie a different persona to it. When you use Shape-Shifter to take that persona, you gain Expertise in the skill.\n**Skin Cant.** You are fluent in Skin Cant, the language of the Changeling Travelers.","pre":"Changeling","fx":{"langs":["Skin Cant"]}},"Juggernaut Plating":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Armor you wear cannot be targeted against your will. Critical Hits against you become normal hits.","full":"Raise Strength or Constitution by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n**Resilient Armor.** While you live, no effect (such as Heat Metal or a rust monster's antennae) can target armor you are wearing against your will.\n**Adamantine Body.** Any Critical Hit against you becomes a normal hit.","pre":"Level 4+, Warforged","asi":["STR","CON"],"fx":{"notes":[["Note","Juggernaut Plating: Critical Hits against you become normal hits"]]}},"Khesh'dar Training":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat. Stealth proficiency and Expertise. The Hide check DC drops to 10.","full":"**Swift and Silent.** You gain proficiency in Stealth.\n**Master of Shadows.** You gain Expertise in Stealth.\n**Fade Away.** When you take the Hide action, the DC for a successful check is 10. All other restrictions still apply.","fx":{"skills":["Stealth"],"exp":["Stealth"]}},"Quori Bond":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Pick a quori lineage for a skill d4 and a spell cast once free per Long Rest.","full":"Raise Intelligence, Wisdom or Charisma by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n**Quori Lineage.** Pick a lineage. Du'ulora: Intimidation and Crown of Madness. Hashataq: Persuasion and Suggestion. Kalaraq: Perception and Mind Spike. Tsucora: Intimidation and Shatter, which deals Psychic damage when cast with this feat.\n**Skill.** When you make an ability check with your lineage's skill, roll 1d4 and add it to the check.\n**Spell.** You always have your lineage's spell prepared. You can cast it once without a slot and regain that use on a Long Rest. You can also cast it with spell slots of the right level. The spell ability is the one this feat raised.","pre":"Level 4+, Kalashtar","asi":["INT","WIS","CHA"]},"Superior Shifting":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Use Shifting at the start of your turn with no action, lasting 10 minutes. One extra use of Shifting.","full":"Raise Strength, Dexterity or Wisdom by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n**Shifting Endurance.** At the start of your turn you can use Shifting with no action. The change now lasts 10 minutes.\n**Shifter Recovery.** You can use Shifting one more time. You regain 1 expended use on a Short Rest and all expended uses on a Long Rest.","pre":"Level 4+, Shifter","asi":["STR","DEX","WIS"]},"Thoughtsinger":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat for Kalashtar. Longer Mind Link range, group telepathy, and the Help action from afar.","full":"**Superior Telepathy.** Mind Link has a range of 120 feet or 10 times your level, whichever is higher.\n**Thoughtsong.** When you use Mind Link to let a creature speak to you telepathically, you form a mental connection with it. When you speak telepathically you can send the message to every creature you are connected to. You can also let them speak to each other telepathically. These effects last as long as the Mind Link does.\n**Telepathic Aid.** If you can speak telepathically to an ally with Mind Link, you can take the Help action to aid their attack against a creature even when you are more than 5 feet away.","pre":"Kalashtar"},"Uul Dhakaan":{"cat":"G","hb":"EE24","d":"Origin feat for Dhakaani. Lucid dreaming, a spirit mentor, and Resistance to Psychic damage.","full":"**Dreamwalker.** You stay fully lucid while you dream and clearly remember all that happened when you wake.\n**Mentor in the Uul.** A spirit in the Uul Dhakaan acts as your mentor. Work with your DM to shape it, such as an ancestor, a fallen hero or a living uul'kala bard. After a Long Rest you may receive a vision, a mission or a clue about your situation.\n**Shielded by Dreams.** You have Resistance to Psychic damage.","pre":"Dhakaani Ghaal'dar, Golin'dar or Guul'dar","fx":{"res":["Psychic"]}}};
